I'm trying to specify a two-factor graded response model with equal discriminations within factors that I'm trying to run:

nc.2Fmodel <- mirt.model('
   F1 = 1, 2, 6, 10, 11, 13, 14, 15, 18
   F2 = 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 12, 16, 17
